{
  "phase": "http_request_cache_settings",
  "rules": [
    {
      "description": "Jangan cache API (form kontak dan endpoint lain)",
      "expression": "(starts_with(http.request.uri.path, \"/api/\"))",
      "action": "set_cache_settings",
      "action_parameters": {
        "cache": false
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Aset build Next.js (nama file ber-hash, aman di-cache lama)",
      "expression": "(starts_with(http.request.uri.path, \"/_next/static/\"))",
      "action": "set_cache_settings",
      "action_parameters": {
        "cache": true,
        "edge_ttl": { "mode": "override_origin", "default": 31536000 },
        "browser_ttl": { "mode": "respect_origin" }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Optimasi gambar Next.js (/_next/image)",
      "expression": "(starts_with(http.request.uri.path, \"/_next/image\"))",
      "action": "set_cache_settings",
      "action_parameters": {
        "cache": true,
        "edge_ttl": { "mode": "override_origin", "default": 86400 },
        "browser_ttl": { "mode": "respect_origin" }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Gambar, font, dan ikon di folder public",
      "expression": "(http.request.uri.path.extension in {\"svg\" \"jpg\" \"jpeg\" \"png\" \"webp\" \"avif\" \"ico\" \"woff\" \"woff2\" \"ttf\" \"otf\" \"css\" \"js\"})",
      "action": "set_cache_settings",
      "action_parameters": {
        "cache": true,
        "edge_ttl": { "mode": "override_origin", "default": 604800 },
        "browser_ttl": { "mode": "respect_origin" }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "File SEO dan AdSense: cache singkat supaya perubahan cepat terbaca",
      "expression": "(http.request.uri.path in {\"/robots.txt\" \"/sitemap.xml\" \"/ads.txt\" \"/manifest.json\"})",
      "action": "set_cache_settings",
      "action_parameters": {
        "cache": true,
        "edge_ttl": { "mode": "override_origin", "default": 3600 },
        "browser_ttl": { "mode": "respect_origin" }
      }
    }
  ],
  "catatan": [
    "HTML tidak punya aturan cache. Layout memakai force-dynamic dan nonce CSP per request, jadi HTML sengaja tidak di-cache di edge.",
    "Urutan penting: aturan /api/ ditaruh pertama. Cek hasil di Caching > Cache Rules setelah diterapkan.",
    "Format ini mengikuti pola cf-waf-rules.json dan cf-ratelimit.json, dan memakai field phase/action_parameters dari Rulesets API. Belum diuji ke zona live."
  ]
}
